{"id": "en_thin_ice_p1", "total": 74.15, "segments": [{"text": "If you fall through frozen water, do not panic and control your breathing right now.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.62}, {"text": "Ethan walks across the lake toward the treeline when the ice shatters beneath his boots instantly.", "start": 4.24, "end": 7.96}, {"text": "He falls into freezing water during the 1st minute of cold shock where panic kills quickly.", "start": 8.52, "end": 12.1}, {"text": "Ethan remembers the 1-10-1 rule giving him 1 minute to control his sudden gasping breath.", "start": 12.88, "end": 16.96}, {"text": "One. He turns back toward the exact direction he came from because that ice held his weight.", "start": 17.46, "end": 21.5}, {"text": "Two. Ethan puts his arms flat on the surface and kicks his legs to get horizontal.", "start": 22.0, "end": 25.72}, {"text": "Three. He pulls his body out of the water using the firm edge of the solid ice.", "start": 26.32, "end": 30.14}, {"text": "Ethan does not stand up because standing concentrates his weight and breaks the ice again.", "start": 30.82, "end": 33.96}, {"text": "He rolls away from the dangerous hole to spread his heavy body weight safely across the ice.", "start": 34.68, "end": 38.42}, {"text": "Ethan begins to crawl slowly toward the safety of the distant tree-lined shore right now.", "start": 39.22, "end": 42.58}, {"text": "He moves with steady purpose while the freezing air steals warmth from his soaking wet clothes.", "start": 43.2, "end": 46.78}, {"text": "Ethan reaches the snowy bank and feels the solid ground beneath his freezing hands at last.", "start": 47.5, "end": 51.22}, {"text": "He survived the deadly freezing water and completed every single survival step without any major errors.", "start": 51.22, "end": 56.68}, {"text": "Ethan stands up by the trees and looks back across the vast expanse of frozen white ice.", "start": 57.4, "end": 61.16}, {"text": "It was the perfect escape plan from the freezing lake. There was jus